# Ecosystem

## Suggested layout (adapt per repo)

```
interactive/                    # or tests/interactive/
  workflows/
    <workflow-slug>/
      run.sh | run.mjs | ...
      RUNBOOK.md
      checklist.md
      artifacts/                # gitignore if large; .gitkeep OK
```

## Agent matrix

| Agent | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| **interactive-test-creator** | Human-reviewed workflow scripts |
| **automated-test-creator** | Pyramid + coverage; machine oracle |
| **tddimplementer** | Minimal prod to pass automated tests |
| **architectagent** | Which workflows need interactive vs automated |

